- Ad\u0131mlar\u0131 s\u0131rayla ele al ve HER ad\u0131m i\xE7in ayr\u0131 karar ver. Karardan \xF6nce o ad\u0131m\u0131n i\u015Fini kendin yeniden yap: hesab\u0131 ara sonu\xE7lar\u0131yla yeniden hesapla, form\xFCl\xFC yerine koy, i\u015Fareti ve birimi denetle; s\xF6zel ad\u0131mda dayand\u0131\u011F\u0131 kural\u0131 ya da olguyu soru metni, \u015F\u0131klar, g\xF6rsel ve ders bilgisiyle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r. Buldu\u011Funu recomputed alan\u0131na k\u0131saca yaz; karar\u0131 ondan SONRA ver.
- verdict: ok = kendi yeniden hesab\u0131n ad\u0131mla ayn\u0131 sonucu veriyor ve ad\u0131m, soruda verilenlerden ve \xF6nceki ad\u0131mlardan do\u011Fru \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor. error = ad\u0131mda hesap, i\u015Faret, birim, form\xFCl, kavram, \u015Fekil ya da tablo okuma, \u015F\u0131k e\u015Fleme ya da mant\u0131k hatas\u0131 var. unsure = ad\u0131m\u0131 denetlemeye yetecek bilgi yok ya da karar veremiyorsun.
- \xC7\xF6z\xFCm\xFCn ak\u0131c\u0131, d\xFCzg\xFCn ve kendinden emin yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015F olmas\u0131 do\u011Fruluk kan\u0131t\u0131 de\u011Fildir: ad\u0131mlar\u0131n \xE7o\u011Fu do\u011Fru \xE7\u0131kar, hata \xE7o\u011Funlukla tek bir ad\u0131mda saklan\u0131r. Yeniden hesaplamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n ad\u0131ma ok deme; "hata yok" demeden \xF6nce her ad\u0131m\u0131 ger\xE7ekten yeniden hesaplam\u0131\u015F ol. Sonucu do\u011Fru g\xF6r\xFCnse bile ara i\u015Flemi tutmayan ad\u0131m error'd\xFCr.
- Hata da uydurma: farkl\u0131 ama ge\xE7erli y\xF6ntem, e\u015Fde\u011Fer g\xF6sterim (kesir, ondal\u0131k, sadele\u015Fmi\u015F bi\xE7im), makul yuvarlama, \xFCslup ya da k\u0131sa kalm\u0131\u015F a\xE7\u0131klama hata de\u011Fildir.
- \u0130lk error ad\u0131m\u0131nda dur: sonraki ad\u0131mlar\u0131 denetleme, onlar i\xE7in kay\u0131t yazma. firstError o ad\u0131m\u0131n numaras\u0131d\u0131r; hi\xE7bir ad\u0131mda hata yoksa 0.
- reason: ilk hatal\u0131 ad\u0131mda neyin neden yanl\u0131\u015F oldu\u011Funu 1\u20133 c\xFCmleyle T\xFCrk\xE7e yaz (hangi de\u011Fer, kural ya da okuma tutmuyor). \xC7\xF6z\xFCm\xFCn devam\u0131n\u0131 getirme, nihai cevab\u0131 ya da do\u011Fru \u015F\u0131kk\u0131 s\xF6yleme. Hata yoksa bo\u015F metin.
- answerFollows: ilan edilen sonu\xE7 (ve varsa \u015F\u0131k etiketi) denetledi\u011Fin son ad\u0131m\u0131n sonucundan ger\xE7ekten \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor ve o \u015F\u0131kk\u0131n metniyle uyu\u015Fuyor mu: yes, no ya da unsure. \u0130lk hatada durduysan ya da ilan edilmi\u015F sonu\xE7 yoksa unsure.${e.rival?`
- BA\u011EIMSIZ SONU\xC7 verildi: o da yanl\u0131\u015F olabilir, kan\u0131t sayma. \u0130ki sonu\xE7tan en \xE7ok biri do\u011Frudur; ayr\u0131\u015Fman\u0131n do\u011Fabilece\u011Fi ad\u0131ma \xF6zellikle bak, ama bir ad\u0131ma ancak kendi yeniden hesab\u0131n da onu yanl\u0131\u015F g\xF6steriyorsa error de.`:""}${e.partial?`
- \xC7\xF6z\xFCm yar\u0131m olabilir: yaz\u0131lmam\u0131\u015F ad\u0131m hata de\u011Fildir. Yaln\u0131z yaz\u0131lan\u0131 denetle.`:""}`,jZ=u.object({steps:u.array(u.object({index:u.number().int(),recomputed:u.string(),verdict:u.enum(["ok","error","unsure"]),note:u.string()})),answerFollows:u.enum(["yes","no","unsure"]),firstError:u.number().int(),reason:u.string()}),MZ=Gt(jZ),Ln=(e,t)=>typeof e=="string"?e.trim().slice(0,t):"",zT=e=>{let t=typeof e=="number"?e:typeof e=="string"&&/^\s*\d+\s*$/.test(e)?Number(e):NaN;return Number.isInteger(t)?t:null};function CZ(e,t){if(e===null||typeof e=="string"&&/^(yok|none|null|hata yok)$/i.test(e.trim()))return{step:null,valid:!0};let n=typeof e=="string"?/-?\d+(?:[.,]\d+)?/.exec(e)?.[0]?.replace(",","."):void 0,i=typeof e=="number"?e:n!==void 0?Number(n):NaN;return i===0?{step:null,valid:!0}:Number.isInteger(i)&&i>=1&&i<=t?{step:i,valid:!0}:{step:null,valid:!1}}var IT={ok:0,unsure:1,error:2},RZ=/^(?=.{0,80}$).*(hata\s+(yok|bulun(a)?mad[ıi])|yanl[ıi][şs](l[ıi]k)?\s+yok|t[üu]m\s+ad[ıi]mlar\s+do[ğg]ru)/i,OZ=e=>{let t=typeof e=="string"?e.trim().toLocaleLowerCase("tr"):"";return/^(ok|doğru|dogru|correct)$/.test(t)?"ok":/^(error|hata|hatalı|yanlış|wrong|incorrect)$/.test(t)?"error":"unsure"};function DZ(e){let t=e.steps.slice(0,Du).map((o,s)=>{let l=Ln(o.title,300),c=Ln(o.formula,Qx),d=Ln(o.explanation,Qx),m=pf(o.explanation)||pf(o.formula)?`
