- \xD6zg\xFCn soru \u015F\u0131kl\u0131ysa yeni sorular da ayn\u0131 say\u0131da \u015F\u0131kl\u0131 olsun (etiketler A, B, C, ...), tek do\u011Fru cevapla ve mant\u0131kl\u0131 \xE7eldiricilerle. A\xE7\u0131k u\xE7luysa options bo\u015F dizi.
