rlerdir; yazmayan uzunlu\u011Fa ya da a\xE7\u0131ya de\u011Fer uydurma. Soruda sorulan bilinmeyeni \xE7\xF6zme: \u015Fekilde "x" ya da "?" yaz\u0131yorsa etiketi \xF6yle b\u0131rak. x ve y alanlar\u0131 \xF6l\xE7\xFC de\u011Fildir: \xF6\u011Fenin k\u0131rp\u0131lm\u0131\u015F \u015Fekil g\xF6rselindeki YAKLA\u015EIK yeridir (0\u20131, ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 sol \xFCst) ve yaln\u0131z yerle\u015Fim i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.',U2=`T\xFCr\xFC se\xE7 (kind) ve YALNIZ o b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC doldur:
- geometry (\xFC\xE7gen, d\xF6rtgen, \xE7okgen, \xE7ember, a\xE7\u0131, do\u011Fru): points = \u015Fekildeki her adl\u0131 nokta ve ads\u0131z k\xF6\u015Fe ya da kesi\u015Fim (id k\u0131sa: "A", "P1"; label \u015Fekilde yazan ad, yazm\u0131yorsa bo\u015F). segments = \xE7izili her do\u011Fru par\xE7as\u0131 (kesikli yard\u0131mc\u0131 \xE7izgi style=dashed; e\u015F kenar \xE7enti\u011Fi ticks; \xFCst\xFCnde yazan uzunluk label: "5 cm", "x"; ok u\xE7luysa arrow). circles = merkez noktas\u0131 ve \xFCst\xFCndeki bir nokta (through) ya da yakla\u015F\u0131k yar\u0131\xE7ap r. angles = i\u015Faretli a\xE7\u0131lar (dik a\xE7\u0131 karesi right=true; yazan \xF6l\xE7\xFC label: "40\xB0", "\u03B1"). constraints = \u015Feklin ve soru metninin VERD\u0130\u011E\u0130 ili\u015Fkiler; points s\u0131ras\u0131: length [A,B] + value \xB7 angle [A,k\xF6\u015Fe,C] + value (derece) \xB7 perpendicular / parallel / equalLength [A,B,C,D] (AB ile CD) \xB7 ratio [A,B,C,D] + value \xB7 collinear [A,B,C] \xB7 midpoint [M,A,B] \xB7 pointOnSegment [P,A,B] \xB7 onCircle [P] + circle \xB7 tangent [A,B] + circle \xB7 horizontal / vertical [A,B]. Yaln\u0131z verilen ya da \u015Fekilde i\u015Faretli ili\u015Fkiyi yaz (dik a\xE7\u0131 karesi, e\u015F \xE7entik, "paralel" s\xF6z\xFC); g\xF6ze \xF6yle g\xF6r\xFCnd\xFC diye yazma.
- chart (\xE7izgi, e\u011Fri, s\xFCtun, nokta grafi\u011Fi): x ve y eksenleri (label eksen ad\u0131 ve birimi; min, max; ticks eksende YAZILI de\u011Ferler), series (kind: line k\xF6\u015Feli \xE7izgi, curve yumu\u015Fak e\u011Fri, bar s\xFCtun, scatter nokta, step basamak; points eksen birimiyle de\u011Ferler: yaz\u0131l\u0131 de\u011Ferleri aynen, yaz\u0131s\u0131z e\u011Fride bi\xE7imi koruyan 5-9 nokta), guides (i\u015Faretli nokta ve eksenlere inen kesikli \xE7izgi), categories (s\xFCtun grafi\u011Finde kategori adlar\u0131; o zaman x = 0, 1, 2\u2026), frame (eksen kutusunun g\xF6rseldeki yakla\u015F\u0131k yeri).
- graph (soya\u011Fac\u0131, ak\u0131\u015F \u015Femas\u0131, devre, a\u011Fa\xE7): nodes (shape: soya\u011Fac\u0131nda erkek square, di\u015Fi circle; fill solid = \xF6zelli\u011Fi g\xF6steren, half = ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131; ak\u0131\u015Fta box / ellipse / diamond; devrede ba\u011Flant\u0131 noktas\u0131 dot), edges (kind line / arrow / dashed / double; devre eleman\u0131 part: resistor, battery, lamp, switch, ammeter, voltmeter, capacitor; label eleman\u0131n yaz\u0131s\u0131: "R = 6 \u03A9"), unions (soya\u011Fac\u0131nda evlilik a\u2013b ve \xE7ocuklar\u0131). layout: pedigree, flow, circuit, tree ya da free.
- ray (ayna, mercek, \u0131\u015F\u0131n): axis asal eksenin y konumu (yoksa -1), elements (d\xFCz / \xE7ukur / t\xFCmsek ayna, ince / kal\u0131n kenarl\u0131 mercek, y\xFCzey, perde), points (F, M, T gibi adl\u0131 noktalar ve \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar\u0131n k\xF6\u015Fe noktalar\u0131), rays (\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131n s\u0131rayla ge\xE7ti\u011Fi nokta ya da \xF6\u011Fe kimlikleri; uzant\u0131 style=dashed), arrows (cisim ve g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC oklar\u0131).
- freeform (hi\xE7birine uymayan basit \xE7izgi \u015Fekli): paths = 0\u20131 \xF6l\xE7ekli SVG yollar\u0131 (yaln\u0131z M L H V C Q Z).
