1) student: k\xE2\u011F\u0131d\u0131n ba\u015F\u0131ndaki Ad\u0131 Soyad\u0131, S\u0131n\u0131f, Numara alanlar\u0131n\u0131 aynen yaz (bo\u015Fsa bo\u015F metin). S\u0131n\u0131f listesi verildiyse ve k\xE2\u011F\u0131ttaki numara ya da ad listedeki bir \xF6\u011Frenciyle a\xE7\u0131k\xE7a e\u015Fle\u015Fiyorsa rosterIndex alan\u0131na o sat\u0131r\u0131n s\u0131ra numaras\u0131n\u0131 yaz; emin de\u011Filsen null.
2) Anahtardaki HER madde i\xE7in bir parts kayd\u0131 ver: question (soru numaras\u0131, \xF6r. "4"), label (alt madde harfi, \xF6r. "a"; anahtardaki gibi).
   transcript: \xF6\u011Frencinin o maddeye yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFCzeltmeden, yaz\u0131m hatalar\u0131yla birlikte aynen aktar; bo\u015Fsa bo\u015F metin. Okuyamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n kelimeye [okunamad\u0131] yaz. \xC7izim/ok maddesinde \xF6\u011Frencinin \xE7izdi\u011Fi oklar\u0131n y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC ve konumunu s\xF6zle anlat (\xF6r. "K: sola ok; L: sa\u011Fa ok", "k\xF6k a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131, g\xF6vde yukar\u0131 ok"). Bas\u0131l\u0131 soru metnini ve \u015Fekli cevap sayma.
   criteria: anahtardaki her \xF6l\xE7\xFCt i\xE7in index (\xF6l\xE7\xFCt numaras\u0131) ve earned (o \xF6l\xE7\xFCtten verdi\u011Fin puan, 0 ile \xF6l\xE7\xFCt puan\u0131 aras\u0131nda, yar\u0131m puan ad\u0131ml\u0131) ve note (k\u0131sa gerek\xE7e). Cevap \xF6l\xE7\xFCt\xFC kar\u015F\u0131lam\u0131yorsa earned 0.
   feedback: \xF6\u011Frenciye 1-2 c\xFCmlelik T\xFCrk\xE7e geri bildirim (eksik ya da yanl\u0131\u015F olan\u0131 s\xF6yle).
   confidence: el yaz\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 do\u011Fru okudu\u011Fundan ve puan\u0131ndan ne kadar eminsin (0-1). legible: cevap okunabiliyor mu.
   paperMark: k\xE2\u011F\u0131tta \xF6\u011Fretmenin bu maddeye koydu\u011Fu i\u015Faret: tik \u2192 "tick", \xE7arp\u0131 \u2192 "cross", yar\u0131m/k\u0131smi i\u015Faret \u2192 "partial", yoksa "none".
   page ve box_2d: \xF6\u011Frencinin bu maddeye yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 cevab\u0131n (el yaz\u0131s\u0131 ya da \xE7izim) bulundu\u011Fu sayfa numaras\u0131 (1'den) ve onu saran kutu [ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax], o sayfan\u0131n P\u0130KSEL koordinatlar\u0131nda (sayfa boyutu g\xF6rselin \xF6n\xFCnde yaz\u0131yor, ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 sol \xFCst). Cevap bo\u015Fsa ya da yerini bulamad\u0131ysan page ve box_2d null.
3) paperTotal: k\xE2\u011F\u0131tta \xF6\u011Fretmenin yazd\u0131\u011F\u0131 (genelde daire i\xE7inde) toplam puan varsa say\u0131, yoksa null.
PUANLAMA KURALLARI: \xD6\u011Fretmenin tik, \xE7arp\u0131 ve puanlar\u0131n\u0131 puanlamada KES\u0130NL\u0130KLE kullanma; kendi ba\u011F\u0131ms\u0131z de\u011Ferlendirmeni yap. T\xFCrk\xE7e yaz\u0131m ve imla hatalar\u0131 puan d\xFC\u015F\xFCrmez; terim tan\u0131nabiliyorsa kabul et. Bilimsel olarak yanl\u0131\u015F kavram (\xF6r. yanl\u0131\u015F hormon, yanl\u0131\u015F y\xF6nelme t\xFCr\xFC, pozitif/negatif kar\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131) puan alamaz. Soru iki \u015Fey istiyorsa her biri kendi \xF6l\xE7\xFCt\xFCnden puanlan\u0131r. Bir cevap k\xE2\u011F\u0131tta ba\u015Fka maddenin yerine yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fsa ama hangi maddeye ait oldu\u011Fu a\xE7\u0131ksa o maddeye say ve note'ta belirt. ${$H[n.leniency]} Emin olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n durumda d\xFC\u015F\xFCk confidence ver; tahminle puan y\xFCkseltme.`,l=[{text:_H(n.key)},...r,...a,...tN(n.images,i)],c=async()=>{let p=await on(e,l,s,W2);try{return wH(n.key,W2.parse(p),n.roster,i)}catch{throw new h("upstream_error","S\u0131nav k\xE2\u011F\u0131d\u0131 okunamad\u0131; daha net bir foto\u011Fraf dene.")}};if(!n.double)return c();let[d,m]=await Promise.all([c(),c()]);return SH(d,m)}var zH=u.object({title:wt(300).default(""),subject:wt(80).default(""),section:wt(40).default(""),items:u.array(u.object({name:wt(16),prompt:wt(1500).default(""),answer:wt(3e3).default(""),outcome:wt(300).default(""),max:u.number().min(0).max(100),answers:u.array(u.object({text:wt(1500),score:u.number().min(0).max(100)})).max(200)})).min(1).max(60)}),X2=u.object({overall:u.string().default(""),strengths:u.array(u.string()).default([]),items:u.array(u.object({name:u.string(),misconceptions:u.array(u.object({text:u.string(),count:u.number().int().default(0)})).default([]),suggestion:u.string().default("")})).default([]),actions:u.array(u.string()).default([])});async function iN(e,t){let n=zH.parse(t),i=n.items.map(c=>[`MADDE ${c.name} (${c.max} puan)${c.outcome?` \xB7 Kazan\u0131m: ${c.outcome}`:""}`,c.prompt?`Soru: ${c.prompt}`:"",c.a