- box: [ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax], P\u0130KSEL cinsinden; o sayfan\u0131n ba\u015F\u0131ndaki etikette verilen geni\u015Flik x y\xFCkseklik \xF6l\xE7\xFCs\xFCne g\xF6re (g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCn\xFCn sol \xFCst\xFC 0,0).
- Kutu \u015Feklin kendisini, \xDCZER\u0130NDEK\u0130 VE \xC7EVRES\u0130NDEK\u0130 ET\u0130KETLER\u0130 ve i\u015Faret \xE7izgilerini (\xF6r. "Kornea", "\u0130ris", "Retina" yaz\u0131lar\u0131) MUTLAKA i\xE7ermeli; bunlar \u015Feklin par\xE7as\u0131d\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca \u015Feklin alt\u0131ndaki/\xFCst\xFCndeki "G\xF6rsel 1.5.11: ..." gibi ba\u015Fl\u0131k sat\u0131r\u0131 (caption) kutunun DI\u015EINDA kals\u0131n.
- caption: kitapta \u015Fekle ait bir etiket/ba\u015Fl\u0131k varsa onunla BA\u015ELA, \xF6r. "G\xF6rsel 1.5.11: G\xF6z\xFCn anatomik yap\u0131s\u0131". Etiket yoksa k\u0131sa bir a\xE7\u0131klama yaz (T\xFCrk\xE7e, en fazla ~120 karakter).
- kind: "figure" (genel \u015Fekil/\xE7izim), "diagram" (s\xFCre\xE7/ili\u015Fki diyagram\u0131), "chart" (veri grafi\u011Fi), "table" (tablo), "photo" (foto\u011Fraf).
- table: kind "table" ise tablonun i\xE7eri\u011Fini H\xDCCRE H\xDCCRE, aynen oku {headers, rows}; say\u0131lar\u0131 ve metinleri de\u011Fi\u015Ftirme, yorumlama; sat\u0131rlarda h\xFCcre say\u0131s\u0131 headers kadar olsun. Okunam\u0131yorsa null. Di\u011Fer t\xFCrlerde null.
- ATLA: QR kodlar\u0131, logolar, "Bilgi Kutusu" gibi yaln\u0131zca metin i\xE7eren kutular, sayfa ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131 ve b\xF6l\xFCm ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131, s\xFCs/dekoratif \xF6\u011Feler, sayfa numaralar\u0131, \xFCst/alt bilgi, \xE7izgi/ayra\xE7lar ve tam sayfa metin bloklar\u0131.
- page: g\xF6rselin ba\u015F\u0131nda verilen sayfa numaras\u0131. Anlaml\u0131 g\xF6rsel yoksa o sayfa i\xE7in kay\u0131t \xFCretme.
