- B\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn ba\u015F\u0131 ve sonu \xF6nceki/sonraki b\xF6l\xFCmle do\u011Fal ge\xE7i\u015Fler kursun (ilk b\xF6l\xFCmde giri\u015F, son b\xF6l\xFCmde toparlama istisnad\u0131r).
- B\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn hedeflerini (goals) kapsa; belgedeki ilgili k\u0131s\u0131mlardan yararlan ve her turun sourcePage alan\u0131n\u0131 doldur.
${DN}
- B\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn toplam konu\u015Fma uzunlu\u011Fu verilen hedef kelime say\u0131s\u0131na yak\u0131n olmal\u0131 (\xB1%10); k\u0131sa kesme.

\xC7\u0131kt\u0131 yaln\u0131zca verilen JSON \u015Femas\u0131na uygun JSON olsun: { "scenes": [...] }.`}var TJ=(e,t)=>Math.round(t.targetMinutes*ec[e.pace]*kJ),ZN=(e,t)=>Math.round(t.targetMinutes*ec[e.pace]);function KN(e,t,n){let i=t.chapters[n],r=TJ(e,i),a=t.chapters.length,o=t.chapters.map((d,m)=>`${m+1}. ${d.title}`).join(`
