- DESTE AKI\u015EI: ${n}. \u0130\xE7erik slaytlar\u0131n\u0131 b\xF6l\xFCmlere dengeli da\u011F\u0131t, i\xE7erik yo\u011Fun olsun (bo\u015F kapak slayt\u0131 \xFCretme); chapterIndex ilgili b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn 0 tabanl\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131 (title/agenda/summary i\xE7in null).
- G\xD6RSEL ANLATIM: Her slayt tek bir \xF6\u011Frenme amac\u0131na hizmet etsin. Ba\u015Fl\u0131k, sadece konu ad\u0131 de\u011Fil kaynaktaki ana fikri anlats\u0131n. Paragraflar\u0131 madde listesine yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rma; ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 notes alan\u0131na ta\u015F\u0131. Ayn\u0131 bilgiyi art arda farkl\u0131 slaytlarda tekrar etme.
- S\xFCre\xE7 i\xE7in y\xF6n\xFC belli steps, ger\xE7ekten tekrar eden s\xFCre\xE7 i\xE7in cycle, ortak \xFCst kavrama ba\u011Fl\u0131 alt kavramlar i\xE7in hierarchy, e\u015F \xF6zellikleri kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmak i\xE7in compare kullan. cycle bilimsel bir d\xF6ng\xFC de\u011Filse kullanma. hierarchy listesinde ilk d\xFC\u011F\xFCm ortak \xFCst kavram, kalan d\xFC\u011F\xFCmlerin TAMAMI onun do\u011Frudan alt kavramlar\u0131d\u0131r.
- Bir \u015Femada tercihen 3-4, en fazla 6 d\xFC\u011F\xFCm; ba\u015Fl\u0131k 2-4 kelime, a\xE7\u0131klama en fazla 70 karakter olsun. Tek d\xFC\u011F\xFCme iki ayr\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce s\u0131\u011Fd\u0131rma. Uzun tablolar\u0131 ayn\u0131 s\xFCtun ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131yla 4 sat\u0131rl\u0131k slaytlara ay\u0131r; sat\u0131r kaybetme.
- \xC7izimler dekoratif dolgu olmas\u0131n: metindeki s\xFCreci, par\xE7alar\u0131n konumunu veya kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 do\u011Frudan a\xE7\u0131klas\u0131n. imagePrompt somut nesneleri, aralar\u0131ndaki ili\u015Fkiyi, bak\u0131\u015F a\xE7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve bo\u015F arka plan\u0131 tarif etsin. Sadece konu ad\u0131n\u0131 yazma. Bir destede tutarl\u0131 \xE7izim dili kullan.
- Slayt t\xFCrleri ve alanlar\u0131 (kullan\u0131lmayan alanlar: bullets i\xE7in [], di\u011Ferleri i\xE7in null):
  - "bullets": bullets 2-5 k\u0131sa madde (her madde en fazla ~90 karakter; slayt ba\u015F\u0131na en fazla 5 madde).
  - "table": table {headers 2-6, rows 1-10; her sat\u0131r\u0131n h\xFCcre say\u0131s\u0131 headers kadar}. Kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmalar ve s\u0131n\u0131flamalar i\xE7in.
  - "chart": chart {type bar|line|pie, title, unit (\xF6r. "%", "milyon TL"; yoksa null), labels 2-12, series 1-3 adet {name, values}; her serinin values uzunlu\u011Fu labels uzunlu\u011Funa E\u015E\u0130T}.
  - "diagram": diagram {layout steps (s\xFCre\xE7)|cycle (d\xF6ng\xFC)|hierarchy (\xFCst-alt)|compare (kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rma), nodes 2-8 adet {title (en fazla 3 kelime), detail (en fazla ~70 karakter)}}.
  - "quote": quote kaynakta ge\xE7en \xE7arp\u0131c\u0131 bir ifade (k\u0131sa).
  - "stat": stat {value (belgedeki \xE7arp\u0131c\u0131 TEK say\u0131, \xF6r. "%40" veya "1,5 milyon"), label (k\u0131sa etiket), context (tek c\xFCmle ba\u011Flam)}. Yaln\u0131zca belgede ger\xE7ekten ge\xE7en bir say\u0131 varsa kullan.
  - "timeline": timeline 2-7 adet {label (tarih/s\u0131ra, k\u0131sa), title, detail}. Yaln\u0131zca belgede kronoloji veya s\u0131ral\u0131 a\u015Famalar varsa.
  - "twoColumn": bullets 2-5 (sol metin; her madde en fazla ~90 karakter) + sa\u011F s\xFCtun i\xE7in ${r?"figureId (a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki \u015Fekil listesinden) veya ":""}${e.includeImages?"imagePrompt (T\xDCRK\xC7E, yaz\u0131s\u0131z sahne tarifi)":"yaln\u0131zca figureId"}.
  - "figure": figureId (ZORUNLU, \u015Fekil listesinden), caption (k\u0131sa), bullets 0-3 k\u0131sa a\xE7\u0131klama. ${r?"":"\u015Eekil listesi bo\u015F: figure slayd\u0131 KULLANMA."}
  - "image": ${e.includeImages?`imagePrompt: T\xDCRK\xC7E, somut bir sahne tarifi (ne g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor, hangi nesneler, nas\u0131l d\xFCzenlenmi\u015F); resimde YAZI YOK: metin, harf, say\u0131, etiket veya ba\u015Fl\u0131k i\xE7ermeyen; fotoger\xE7ek\xE7i olmayan d\xFCz e\u011Fitim \xE7izimi tarz\u0131. Deste ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 veya slayt ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 imagePrompt'a ASLA yazma. Deste "daha resimli" olmal\u0131: en az 3, en fazla ${Pw} adet image/twoColumn(imagePrompt'lu) slayd\u0131 kullan.`:"KULLANMA (image slayd\u0131 \xFCretme)."}
${r?`- KAYNAK \u015EEK\u0130LLER\u0130: figureId yaln\u0131zca istekteki \u015Fekil listesinden se\xE7ilir; her \u015Fekil EN FAZLA B\u0130R KEZ kullan\u0131l\u0131r; ilgili oldu\u011Fu b\xF6l\xFCmde ve uygun yerde kullan. \u0130stekteki HER \u015Fekil i\xE7in bir "figure" slayd\u0131 ZORUNLUDUR (tablo \u015Fekilleri dahil; tablo \u015Feklini "figure" slayd\u0131yla g\xF6ster).
`:""}- TABLO, GRAF\u0130K ve "stat" verileri YALNIZCA kaynak notlar\u0131nda veya b\xF6l\xFCm metinlerinde A\xC7IK\xC7A ge\xE7en say\u0131lardan olu\u015Fsun; say\u0131 uydurma, hesaplay\u0131p t\xFCretme. Belgede say\u0131sal veri yoksa grafik ve stat \xDCRETME; onun yerine diyagram veya tablo kullan.
- Her slayt i\xE7in notes: 2-4 c\xFCmlelik konu\u015Fmac\u0131 notu, podcast anlat\u0131m\u0131yla uyumlu. sourcePages: ilgili belge sayfalar\u0131 (bilinmiyorsa []).
- subtitle: deste i\xE7in k\u0131sa alt ba\u015Fl\u0131k (section slaytlar\u0131nda b\xF6l\xFCm alt ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131).
\xC7\u0131kt\u0131 yaln\u0131zca verilen JSON \u015Femas\u0131na uygun JSON olsun.`}function X7(e){let t=e.figures.length?`

